[["heading","P RACTICAL PROJECT / PART 1\nLocal web server and network diagnostics"],["sinhala","","Local machine එJක් server එකක් run කරලා HTTP request එකක් යවමු. IP, port, process සහ response",501],["sinhala","","status එක සමේබන්ධ Jවන ආකාරය බලන්න.",217],["text","Use two terminals in a disposable directory. Python 3 and curl are required; commands below use a\nPOSIX shell (Linux, macOS or WSL). The server binds only to loopback. Choose a different unused port\nif 8000 is occupied."],["text","curl client\n127.0.0.1:8000\nPython server\nHTTP response"],["heading","Terminal 1 — create and serve"],["code","mkdir -p os-network-lab\ncd os-network-lab\nprintf 'Hello network\\n' > index.html\npython -m http.server 8000 --bind 127.0.0.1"],["heading","Terminal 2 — observe and test"],["code","curl -i http://127.0.0.1:8000/\ncurl -i http://127.0.0.1:8000/missing.txt\n# Linux (if installed): ss -ltn"],["text","Expected: First request: HTTP 200 and Hello network. Missing path: HTTP 404. Stop the server in terminal\n1 with Ctrl+C, then retry the first request: connection fails if no other service is listening."],["heading","Practice"],["text","Explain the difference between a valid HTTP error response and a connection failure. Do not expose\nthe demo server publicly; it is not a production web server."]]